[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-overview-1600x120.png[/img]
Venworks Canvas is a shared Player HUD framework for Starfield. Compatible UI add-ons use one common host instead of each add-on replacing the Player HUD on its own.

Canvas is a foundation for compatible add-ons, not a standalone HUD theme. Install the base package first, then install the Canvas add-ons you want to use.

[b]The downloads are separate packages:[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Venworks Canvas[/b] — the required base runtime and shared Player HUD host.[/*]
[*][b]Venworks Canvas Example[/b] — an optional example panel that demonstrates player data, a clock, buff and debuff counts, and rotating effect rows.[/*]
[*][b]Venworks Canvas Component Gallery[/b] — an optional live reference for creators that shows supported Canvas HTML, CSS, components, and data bindings beside their rendered results.[/*]
[/list]

[quote]
[size=4][b][u]Venworks Discord Community[/u][/b][/size]

I’ve reopened the [url=https://discord.gg/DTbmrJDMxZ]Venworks Discord community[/url] as a central place for my mods, modding research, support, beta feedback, and bug reports. 

I'll continue releasing my mods here on Nexus and through the Bethesda Game Studios Creations site (mostly for consoles), but recent site updates have made Nexus notifications and the Bugs and Posts sections less reliable.
[/quote]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-features-1600x120.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Gives compatible add-ons a shared Player HUD/UI host and data exchange layer.[/*]
[*]Keeps add-on registration and loading in the Canvas base package.[/*]
[*]Supports normal and large interface modes.[/*]
[*]Renders a focused game-UI subset of HTML and CSS, including styled text, lists, buttons, SVG images, reusable content, and bound data.[/*]
[*]Provides shared player values and named events for compatible panels.[/*]
[*]Lets add-ons publish their own small Canvas datagrams for state and event data.[/*]
[/list]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-roadmap-1600x120.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Handling of custom menus[/*]
[*]More shared data subscriptions and events[/*]
[/list]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-usage-instructions-1600x120.png[/img]
The Canvas base package works in the background and does not add a complete HUD theme by itself. Install a compatible Canvas add-on to add a visible panel.

The optional Example panel demonstrates a real independently packaged consumer. The optional Component Gallery can be opened from the Pause Menu and browsed with Up/Down, the right stick, the mouse wheel, or the scrollbar. Cancel returns to the Pause Menu.

