[/list]

[size=4][b]Compatibility[/b][/size]

Canvas 1.0 is a Player HUD and UI framework. It owns complete Player HUD and UI files, so another mod that replaces the same files can overwrite Canvas or be overwritten by it according to package priority. Do not combine competing full-HUD replacements unless the authors provide an explicit compatibility patch.

Keep Canvas and its add-ons on mutually compatible versions. The Example and Component Gallery require the Canvas base package but are not required by ordinary Canvas add-ons unless their authors say otherwise.

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-installation-instructions-1600x120.png[/img]
[size=4][b]Vortex or Mod Organizer 2[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Install and enable Venworks - Core Utilities version 2.1.8 or newer.[/*]
[*]Install and enable Venworks Canvas.[/*]
[*]Install the optional Example or Component Gallery files only if you want them.[/*]
[*]Allow the plugin masters to keep Core before Canvas and Canvas before its optional add-ons.[/*]
[/list]

